{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"generate validate and monitor lifecycle generate validate and monitor lifecycle","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","fileName":"Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted DevOps Practice]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"generate validate and monitor lifecycle generate validate and monitor lifecycle","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","fileName":"Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle","heading":"Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The generate, validate, and monitor lifecycle is a basic control pattern for AI-assisted DevOps. A model first generates a bounded artifact such as an infrastructure template, workflow, pull-request summary, release note, or incident report. Engineering checks then establish whether the artifact is syntactically valid, factually grounded, secure, and suitable for the repository.\n\nMonitoring continues after acceptance by observing workflow results, cost, latency, and failures. The lifecycle prevents fluent output from becoming an implicit approval: generation creates a candidate, validation establishes fitness, and monitoring supplies evidence for later correction.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"generate validate and monitor lifecycle generate validate and monitor lifecycle","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","fileName":"Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Generate Validate and Monitor Lifecycle","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}